              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 16.1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Likhebulila lie Pasaka eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi lili khu ndaalo eye likhumi na chine eye kumwesi kwa lulala ekolooba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.14+EXO.12.15+EXO.12.16+EXO.12.17+EXO.12.18+EXO.12.19+EXO.12.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khur. 12.14-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "23.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.3+DEU.16.4+DEU.16.5+DEU.16.6+DEU.16.7+DEU.16.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 16.3-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naikara eye kumukaati kukhalimo limela erakikha khu ndaalo eye likhumi na kharaano. Ne khulwe chindaalo saba, mulalia kumukaati kukhalimo limela tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu ndaalo eye khunyoa yino mulaba ne libuusiana litakatifu. Ne se mukholakho kumulimo kumuandalafu tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulaana khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi siianwa sie khukhwosia khulwe chindaalo saba. Khu ndaalo eya saba libao libuusiana litakatifu. Ne khu ndaalo eyo se mukholakho kumulimo kumuandalafu tawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Musa ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Boolela babaandu ba Isiraeli oli, ‘Nga ne mwingila mu sibala nisio ndikho muelesia, ne mukesile, mukhoya muyilile omusaayi sinywa sie likesa lienywe lie khunyoa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusaayi alaana sinywa esio ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, nio mufukiililwe. Omusaayi alaana sinywa khu ndaalo eloondela e sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu ndaalo niyo oanilakho sinywa sie likesa olaanilakho lundi limiiku lie kumwiiko mulala, lilayi likhalikho bubi tawe, nga siianwa sie khukhwosia khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lundi okhoya oaane bufu butiiti mu ndubi butubaasibwe ne kamafura nga siianwa sie kumulimo siunya bulayi khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Lundi mukhoya muaane endali endiiti eli nga siianwa sie khunywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhaliaakho kumukaati namwe biakhulia bikhalange, namwe biibisi khukhwola khu ndaalo niyo mureerera biianwa bino khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Lilaka lino licha khubao khu selukho choosi che lisaaye lienywe, khulwa mindali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
