            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.9+DEU.16.10+DEU.16.11+DEU.16.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 16.9-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “ ‘Mubale kamachuuma saba kamamuufu khukhwamila khu ndaalo eloondela e sabato, khu ndaalo niyo muanilakho sinywa sie siianwa sie khusuta ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu ndaalo eye kamakhumi karaano, khu ndaalo eloondela esabato eya saba, aana khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi siianwa sie biakhulia biyaaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulareera kimikaati kibili khukhwama niio mwamenya mala kiaanwe khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Kimikaati kino kikholwa khukhwama khu bufu bubwola enusu eye ndubi bukhalimo limela tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne alala ne kumukaati mukhaane kamameeme saba ke kumwiiko mulala kakhalikho ne bubi tawe, euunwa enjoka ndala ne kamamiiku kabili, bilaanwa khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nga biianwa bie khukhwosia, alala ne biianwa bie biakhulia ne biianwa bie khunywa, ne kumuuya kumulayi kusimisia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lundi mulaana endurume nga siianwa sirusiao bubwoni, ne kamamiiku kamaana kabili ke kumwiiko mulala nga embosio eye kumuleembe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omusaayi alabiaana ne kumukaati kwe bibiaamo bie bweeni nga biianwa bie khusuta ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, ne kamameeme kabili, bilaba bitakatifu khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi khulwe basaayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu ndaalo eyo mukhakhola kimilimo kienywe kia busiele tawe, nekhali mulebuusia alala khulwe lisaaya.Lilaka lino licha khuba khu selukho choosi che lisaaye lienywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
