                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Musa ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Boolela babaandu ba Isiraeli oli, ‘Naikara eye Bisali eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi elarakikha khu ndaalo eye khumi na chiraano eye kumwesi kwa saba mala echiililile khulwe chindaalo saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu ndaalo eye khunyoa mu ndaalo chino, mulebuusia alala khulwe lisaaya. Ne mukhakhola kumulimo kumuandalafu tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwe chindaalo saba, mulaana biianwa bie khukhwosia khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Ne khu ndaalo ekhola munaane mulecha alala lundi khulwe lisaaya mala muaane siianwa sie khukhwosia khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Eli endaalo eye lisaaya, ne mukhakholakho kumulimo kumuandalafu tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Chino chili naikara chindobore cha Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, nicho mukhakhole nga libuusiana litakatifu, khulwe khureera biianwa bie kumulilo khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, ne khuaana biianwa bie biakhulia, biianwa bie khukhwosia, chimbosio ne biianwa bie khunywa. Buli sibira siekholekhe khu ndaalo yasio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naikara chino chili busa khutasa khwicho che chisabato cha Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, ne khu biianwa bienywe, nende nibio mweana khurusilia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Khu ndaalo eye likhumi na chiraano eye kumwesi kwa saba nga ne muba ne mukesile biakhulia bienywe, mukhole lisaaya lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi khulwe chindaalo saba. Ne mukhoya mwauluukha khu ndaalo eye khunyoa nende endaalo ekhola munaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu ndaalo eye khunyoa, mulabuta kamatuunda malala kamalayi khukhila koosi khukhwama khu mirongooro kienywe kie kamatuunda. Ne lundi mulabuta chisakia che kamakheendu ne chisakia che kamasaafu kamakali. Mulekhoya ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe khulwe chindaalo saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhakhebulilenge naikara eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi khu ndaalo saba buli mwiiko. Lilaka lino lilaliindwa ne lisaaye lienywe khulwa mindali. Mukhakholenge khu mwesi kwa saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu ba Isiraeli boosi balamenya mu bisali khulwe chindaalo saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano kalakhola be lisaaye lienywe bamanye bali ese nakhola babaandu ba Isiraeli bamenya mu bisali nga ne nabarusia mu sibala sie Misiri. Ese ndi Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Nio mungila yino Musa aana kamalaka khuloondekhana ne chindaalo chindobore che chi naikara cha Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.44"
